    competencyIds: ['WEBD-R2-C018', 'WEBD-R2-C019', 'WEBD-R2-C020', 'WEBD-R2-C014'],
    studyObjective: 'Use native form structure and constraints as the foundation, add one bounded trim rule and associated messages, then test actual keyboard and reflow behavior without claiming that an automated score proves accessibility.',
